# === TASK (FREE TEXT) ===
1) Briefly describe the disagreement (what LLM decided vs what SMT decided).
2) Explain the most likely reason for the mismatch, grounded in the evidence above.
   - If you need to reference evidence, quote only the few most important lines/snippets.
3) Decide which side is more likely “at fault”:
   - LLM judge problem, or
   - SMT pipeline problem, or
   - both / unclear
4) Suggest a few concrete fixes, prioritized, with where to change it (judge prompt vs SMT mining/defaulting/encoding/eval).

Write in natural language. No JSON/XML formatting requirements.
